# ⚡ CollabCode — Collaborative Code Editor

A real-time collaborative coding platform where multiple users can write, edit, compile, and execute Java code together in the same session.

Built with React, Monaco Editor, Spring Boot WebSockets, and MySQL.

## 🚀 Features

- Real-time collaborative code editing
- Multiple users in the same session
- Character-level operation synchronization
- Operation-based synchronization
- Version tracking
- Undo / Redo
- MySQL code persistence
- Shareable session URLs
- Connected user count
- Monaco Editor
- Java syntax highlighting
- Java code compilation
- Java code execution
- Compilation error handling
- Runtime error handling
- Program execution timeout
- Live output console

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend

- React
- Vite
- JavaScript
- Monaco Editor
- CSS

### Backend

- Java
- Spring Boot
- Spring WebSocket
- Spring Data JPA
- Hibernate
- Maven

### Database

- MySQL

### Code Execution

- Java Compiler (`javac`)
- Java Runtime (`java`)
- Temporary execution directories
- Execution timeout

